00:13:46.831 --> 00:13:47.330
Team.

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:50.370
This is focused more
towards news websites.

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:53.372
And this is more of an
experience than a dashboard.

00:13:53.372 --> 00:13:54.830
And we'll show you
what this means.

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:58.570
We'll first search for the
Google Merchandise Store

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:00.960
analytics data.

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:03.800
And as you select
